  "note": "For ℓ = 3, τ = 2, β = π/8 the foot of the perpendicular has |u∘| = 1.764324, as (8.39) gives. Not needed in Lean: the rotated-ray integrand carries r^{σ+1}, which integral_rpow_exp_quad_le handles by r^p ≤ 1 + r², so no distance-to-origin bound occurs."
